## 5. Documentation & Comments Standard

### 5.1 File Headers (MANDATORY)

Every file MUST have a top-level comment block:

```javascript
// ============================================================================
// AdminDashboard — PulseOps V1 Admin Module
//
// PURPOSE: Main dashboard for platform administrators. Displays system
// health, module status, and quick-access admin controls.
//
// ARCHITECTURE: React component exported from admin/manifest.jsx.
// Receives props: { user, onNavigate, onModulesChanged }.
//
// DEPENDENCIES:
//   - @shared → Card, Button, LoadingSpinner
//   - @modules/admin/uiText.json → UI text
//   - @modules/admin/services/adminService.js → Admin API calls
// ============================================================================
```

### 5.2 JSDoc (COMPREHENSIVE)

All functions, hooks, and services MUST include JSDoc:

```javascript
