## 8. Testing & Quality Assurance

### 8.1 Unit Tests (REQUIRED)

- Write unit tests for all business logic (services, utilities, middleware).
- Use Jest or Vitest.
- Aim for >80% code coverage.

### 8.2 Integration Tests (REQUIRED)

- Test API endpoints with realistic request/response flows.
- Test authentication flows (login, refresh, logout).
- Test module loading and hot-dropping.

### 8.3 E2E Tests (RECOMMENDED)

- Use Playwright or Cypress for critical user flows.
- Test deep linking and URL routing.
- Test module switching and navigation.

