## 11. Glossary & Key Terms

- **Core Module:** Statically imported at build (auth, platform_admin). Cannot be disabled.
- **Add-on Module:** Hot-dropped at runtime (logging, api_manager, demo). Can be enabled/disabled.
- **Hot-Drop:** Dynamic loading of a module at runtime without rebuilding the app.
- **Manifest:** Self-describing module contract (id, name, views, tabs, etc.).
- **Dual-Auth:** Supporting both HttpOnly cookies (frontend) and Bearer headers (API tools).
- **Deep Linking:** Ability to navigate directly to a specific URL (e.g., `/admin/moduleManager`).
- **Cache Busting:** Appending version/hash to URLs to force fresh downloads.
- **Request ID:** Unique UUID per request for distributed tracing and debugging.

